  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nSONG OF SONGS is a 42.2m (138.5ft) motor yacht built in GRP to RINA classification, delivered in 2022 under the Cayman Islands flag. Designed inside and out by Italy's VYD Design, the yacht features extensive glass elements, including floor-to-ceiling windows and glazed bulwark cut-outs, offering infinity views. The main saloon includes a forward dining room, a lounge and bar area separated by a large TV, while the sun deck provides shaded dining for 12, lounge seating, a bar, and versatile aft space for entertainment or relaxation.\n\nThe yacht accommodates 12 guests in six suites, including an upper deck owner’s suite with a private terrace. Other features include a jacuzzi on the foredeck, an air-conditioned beach club cabana, and a tender garage with horizontal davits. Powered by twin Caterpillar engines, SONG OF SONGS cruises at 13 knots with a top speed of 19 knots and a range of 2,000nm.",
